6, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 747, "last_played": 1663115665, "avatar": "97bf6647d76886a43b5b0599ff8192b19a26250e"}, "language": "english", "review": "quarantine has been ok since this came out", "timestamp_created": 1592264375, "timestamp_updated": 1592264375, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70858963", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079654068", "personaname": "Ham", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/iambasedgod/", "num_games_owned": 163, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 408, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 224, "last_played": 1781086849, "avatar": "f0783d6fec8ba9b21b7208b7252f65e5df95833c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game at it's core is great, but there are many tweaks it needs to maintain it's player base. \n1. Change the progression system. The progression in this game is nearly nonexistent. You barely get any skill points in the first dungeon and it takes forever just to get a measly 20-30 skill points.\n2. This first boss is absolute B.S. there is no reason why the first boss should be nearly impossible to defeat unless you have a full team of players that are level 20+\n3. After you miraculously manage to beat the first boss, you should not have to go through the same old dungeon with the same old enemies and the same old final boss just to get to the second stage again. It comes back to the lack of progression.\n\nAll in all this is a great looking game with fun weapons and art style but in its current state just feels like groundhog day. That being said, I cannot recommend this game in its current state but I am looking forward to updates and I am hopeful for the future of this game :)", "timestamp_created": 1592262986, "timestamp_updated": 1592262986, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.455847263336181641", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1592272409, "developer_response": "Hi, we are aware of the difficulty and plan to make some adjustment in our future update.Thanks for playing our game and providing feedback.", "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70858830", "author": {"steamid": "76561198800032300", "personaname": "Cornholio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198800032300/", "num_games_owned": 349, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 879, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 240, "last_played": 1668584487, "avatar": "a8091fa7e1c73cf1289ef49f74e105e0c0f5562f"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game can play for 5  minutes or as long as you want", "timestamp_created": 1592262730, "timestamp_updated": 1592262730, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "70858555", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054654515", "personaname": "BuddyMocha", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BuddyMocha/", "num_games_owned": 601, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 2739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 857, "last_played": 1755215873, "avatar": "8ab2898f1d64bf0fec3d87919e60e3b0555f918d"}, "language": "english", "review": "is a good game. takes a while to learn the movement necessary for certain areas but overall it is a great rogueli